{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226550","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226550","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1422655001:1":{"text":"这里，真是与我想象得格外不同。","source_cn":"这里，真是与我想象得格外不同。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD80A7ED5F74AB795","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422655002:1":{"text":"尽管我已经做过心理准备，知道此处会与萨洛克兰大相径庭，但还是感到意外。","source_cn":"尽管我已经做过心理准备，知道此处会与萨洛克兰大相径庭，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF038E72F761BE377","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422655003:1":{"text":"这里的一切都是如此的，轻松，自由而又愉快。","source_cn":"这里的一切都是如此的，轻松，自由而又愉快。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22D8AD882C75DBE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422655004:1":{"text":"也有紧张，同样也少不了纠纷。","source_cn":"也有紧张，同样也少不了纠纷。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAF39F10A50814C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422655005:1":{"text":"自私、嫉妒、欺骗、伤害，我们并不能免俗。","source_cn":"自私、嫉妒、欺骗、伤害，我们并不能免俗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4065BFD14C294F99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422655006:1":{"text":"但，那并不是猜疑，恐慌与憎恨。至少不是普遍的情绪。","source_cn":"但，那并不是猜疑，恐慌与憎恨。至少不是普遍的情绪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90A94D65EDFE3D54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422655007:1":{"text":"如果艾塞勒也一直被弥萨忒爱着，那么，会不会……","source_cn":"如果艾塞勒也一直被弥萨忒爱着，那么，会不会……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x864283331DB653E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422655008:1":{"text":"抱歉，我失态了。我能不能走近看看皎月树？","source_cn":"抱歉，我失态了。我能不能走近看看皎月树？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF511CD91F08C5F27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422655009:1":{"text":"花匠提到的守护之树令我很是好奇。或许……","source_cn":"花匠提到的守护之树令我很是好奇。或许……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB6EEC442BEFB4CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422655010:1":{"text":"当然，请便。","source_cn":"当然，请便。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72C0622AC1E13612","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"因度厄","source":"因度厄","status":"source"},"speaker:布莱恩":{"text":"布莱恩","source":"布莱恩","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":11,"local